@out@outlawmustanglx More total return with no dividends beats less total return even if the lower return pays a high dividend. All day, every day.  Even if you believe otherwise.  If you’d like to find an example where that’s not the case, I’d be happy to see it. When you go looking for it maybe it’ll finally click for you.  

Don’t feel bad. I didn’t figure it until I was about your age. 

Good luck.
